‘Augmentation’ refers to the practice of inserting an affine map between input and initial value, to increase the dimension of the hidden state. That is, given some input x ∈ Rd, the initial value of the ODE is taken to be y(0) = gθ(x) for some learnt gθ : Rd → Rdl with dl > d, rather than simply y(0) = x. We have
